{"id":"erwachen","lemma":"erwachen","pos":"verb","rank":4763,"glosses":["to awake (also figuratively)"],"ipa":"/ɛɐ̯ˈvaxn̩/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/44/De-erwachen.ogg/De-erwachen.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"erwache","1p":"erwachen","2s":"erwachst","2p":"erwacht","3s":"erwacht","3p":"erwachen"},"preterite":{"1s":"erwachte","1p":"erwachten","2s":"erwachtest","2p":"erwachtet","3s":"erwachte","3p":"erwachten"},"perfect":{"1s":"bin erwacht","1p":"sind erwacht","2s":"bist erwacht","2p":"seid erwacht","3s":"ist erwacht","3p":"sind erwacht"},"future":{"1s":"werde erwachen","1p":"werden erwachen","2s":"wirst erwachen","2p":"werdet erwachen","3s":"wird erwachen","3p":"werden erwachen"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"erwach","2p":"erwacht"}},"subjunctive":{"conditional":{"1s":"würde erwachen","1p":"würden erwachen","2s":"würdest erwachen","2p":"würdet erwachen","3s":"würde erwachen","3p":"würden erwachen"}}},"nonFinite":{"participle":"erwacht"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich erwachte aus einem Traum.","en":"I awoke from a dream.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"(to) a","l":"ein"},{"g":"dream"}]},{"text":"Sie müssen erwachen.","en":"You need to wake up.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to have to"},null]},{"text":"Er erwachte, nackt und verwirrt.","en":"He woke up naked and confused.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"nude"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"confused"}]},{"text":"Als sie erwachte, war ihr schrecklich kalt.","en":"When she awoke, she felt terribly cold.","words":[{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"awfully, terribly"},{"g":"cold, chilly"}]},{"text":"Als ich diesen Morgen erwachte, war ich hungrig.","en":"When I awoke this morning, I felt hungry.","words":[{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"tomorrow"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"hungry"}]}]}